@startuml
title Figure 1.1 - High-Level System Architecture of Data Quality Inspector

left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor User

rectangle "Data Quality Inspector System" {
    component "User Interface\n(Web Browser)" as UI
    component "File Handling\nComponent" as FH
    component "Data Quality Analysis\nComponent" as DA
    component "Report Generation\nComponent" as RG
    component "Cleaning and Data\nComparison Component" as CC
    component "Error Message\nHandling" as EH

    UI --> FH : Upload CSV file
    FH --> DA : Validated dataset
    DA --> RG : Detected issues\nand analysis results
    RG --> UI : Quality report\nand cleaning suggestions
    UI --> CC : User-approved\ncleaning action
    CC --> UI : Cleaned dataset\nand before/after summary
    FH --> EH : File reading error
    EH --> UI : Display error message
}

User --> UI : Upload dataset\nReview report\nApprove cleaning

note bottom of CC
Cleaning actions are applied
only after user approval.
The original dataset is preserved.
end note

@enduml
